<h2 id="why-i-chose-buffer-jelly">Why I chose Experiment Beauty Buffer Jelly</h2>
<p>I first saw the Buffer Jelly on my TikTok feed in early 2026, and the results for barrier repair looked incredible. As someone living in the humid but air-conditioned environment of Hong Kong, my skin barrier often feels compromised. This indie brand, Experiment Beauty, created a specialized slugging product that isn't as messy as traditional petroleum jelly. I knew I had to try it, but I quickly realized a major problem: it is not sold anywhere in Tsim Sha Tsui or Central.</p><div class="row g-0 my-5 border" id="instantForm">
