    <td><strong>Volumetric Warning</strong></td>
    <td>Low. This item is dense and small, so you will likely be charged by actual weight rather than size.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Battery Check</strong></td>
    <td>None. This product contains no lithium batteries or electronic components.</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>I checked the <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/shipping_rates/">international shipping rates</a> to see if I should add more items to my shipment. Since <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/shipping_rates/">shipping fees</a> often have a minimum base rate, I usually add a few more skincare favorites to my cart to make the <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/calculator/">shipping calculator</a> results more cost-effective per item.</p>

<h2 id="final-cost-comparison">Is the import cost worth it?</h2>
<p>In my experience, even with the <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/shipping_rates/">international shipping</a> costs, it was still cheaper than buying from a local middleman. Plus, I have the peace of mind knowing the product is fresh from the 2026 production batch. You might also like to <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/blogs/experiment-beauty-buffer-jelly-costs-significantly-more-in-hong-kong-than-in-us-retail-stores">Read more: Experiment Beauty Buffer Jelly costs significantly more in Hong Kong than in US retail stores</a> if you want a full price breakdown.</p>
<p>My skin has never looked better since I started using this jelly at night. If you are struggling with the Hong Kong humidity and air-con cycle, we highly recommend looking into US-based barrier repairs that haven't hit our shores yet. If you get stuck, the <a href="https://www.comgateway.com/faq/">support</a> team at your forwarder can usually help you through the customs process.</p>

